{
  "description": "A large quadrupedal creature is shown in right-facing profile standing on a small patch of dry, sparsely vegetated ground. The body, legs and tail are feline and muscular with short tawny-brown fur, while the head, neck and chest are covered in dense raptor-like feathers and bear a hooked beak and two large outstretched wings on the upper back. The overall coloration is golden-brown and tan with darker brown on the wing tips, chest and tail tuft and cream patches on the neck and chest. Both wings are fully spread upward and outward, the four sturdy legs end in large clawed paws on the ground, and a long slender tail with a dark tuft hangs down behind.",
  "parts": [
    {
      "part": "head",
      "looks_like": "raptor-like, covered in golden-brown feathers with a large hooked beak that is dark gray at the tip and yellow at the cere and along the gape, a yellow eye with a dark pupil and a fierce expression, no visible external ears",
      "where": "at the front of the body on top of the feathered neck, facing to the right"
    },
    {
      "part": "legs",
      "looks_like": "four thick, muscular mammalian legs covered in short tawny fur that is lighter cream on the underside and inner surfaces, with visible musculature and joints",
      "where": "beneath the torso, two forelegs under the chest and two hind legs under the hips, supporting the body"
    },
    {
      "part": "feet",
      "looks_like": "large rounded paws with light tan fur, blunt dark claws and thick pads visible at the toes",
      "where": "at the bottom of each of the four legs, resting on the ground"
    },
    {
      "part": "tail",
      "looks_like": "long, slender and fur-covered, tawny along its length and ending in a dark brown to black tuft of longer hair",
      "where": "extending from the rear of the body at the rump, hanging down and curving slightly toward the ground on the left side of the image"
    },
    {
      "part": "wings",
      "looks_like": "two very large, fully outstretched feathered wings with layered flight feathers in shades of golden-brown, tan, cream and dark brown, darker at the tips and along the trailing edges, with detailed overlapping coverts",
      "where": "attached to the upper back behind the neck, one on the near side prominently in the foreground and one on the far side visible behind it, both raised upward and spread outward"
    },
    {
      "part": "mane",
      "looks_like": "a shaggy ruff of longer feathers and fur, dark brown mixed with cream and golden-brown, hanging and slightly tousled",
      "where": "around the lower neck and chest, extending from under the head down over the front of the forelegs"
    },
    {
      "part": "feathers",
      "looks_like": "dense overlapping feathers of varying size, golden-brown on the head, cream and brown mottled on the neck and chest, and layered brown and tan on the wings with darker barring on the flight feathers",
      "where": "covering the head, neck, chest and both wings"
    },
    {
      "part": "markings",
      "looks_like": "tawny-brown base color with lighter cream patches on the side of the neck and chest, darker brown shading on the back, wing coverts and tail tuft, and subtle darker mottling and barring on the wing feathers",
      "where": "over the entire body, most contrast on the neck, chest and wings"
    }
  ],
  "attached_objects": [],
  "animals": [
    "eagle",
    "lion"
  ],
  "separate_bodies": 1,
  "heads": 1,
  "walking_legs": 4,
  "wings": 2,
  "extra_limb_pieces": 0
}
